Available commands
  status                    - Show current system status
  rain river amount     - Add rainfall to a river
  simulate                  - Run one day of simulation
  simulate days           - Run multiple days
  flow river              - Show flow for specific river
  help                      - Show this help
  exit                      - Exit simulation

